{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2026-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1780272000, "end_date": 1780963199, "month_true_total": 629, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:30:20 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "227523506", "author": {"steamid": "76561198086893242", "personaname": "Zac", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198086893242/", "num_games_owned": 181, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 2602, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1634, "last_played": 1782006500, "avatar": "37cf1dc1f48ac849fb89a0b11182816609a9e6eb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rock and stone", "timestamp_created": 1780958948, "timestamp_updated": 1780958948, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227519192", "author": {"steamid": "76561199231931970", "personaname": "Mrkrunklepop", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199231931970/", "num_games_owned": 156, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 9711, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6533, "deck_playtime_at_review": 6368, "last_played": 1786338189, "avatar": "979ffbfcfe2587d6e02e72a4a0cf130e022f8230"}, "language": "english", "review": "yeah", "timestamp_created": 1780954227, "timestamp_updated": 1780954227, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227511146", "author": {"steamid": "76561198250649010", "personaname": "Gamelito", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Gamelito/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 14499, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14243, "last_played": 1786089995, "avatar": "ea7c671b03a3cd2e063c83249568adbb908d1311"}, "language": "english", "review": "We work, to get the right to work. However, the work, despite being dangerous as hell, is also rewarding. Incredible dental plan, too.\nJokes aside, this game is addictive. A looter shooter done right. Areas and missions are varied, the gunplay is satisfying, the guns themselves are really creative and fun to use, enemies can be SCARY and the moments born from the combinations of the factors listed above never fail to make me scream or smile. \nThere's nothing more nerve-wracking than barely surviving a horde of glyphids, and then having to deal with a Wroughtnaught born from the deepest pits of hell. \nCosmetic content is great, and FREE! Not only that, but you can also return to previous seasons to grind, so NO FOMO!\nMy only gripe is that, after like, binging a ton of missions, the game can get a bit stale. Nothing than a break won't fix. I promise you'll be back, grinding and rockin' and stonin'.\nA bloody must play.", "timestamp_created": 1780946957, "timestamp_updated": 1780946957, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.621134817600250244", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227496353", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049954127", "personaname": "BustaChime", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BustaChime/", "num_games_owned": 647, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 8425, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_re